{"id":429,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"The incantations Mismagius chants can ward against misfortune, so a custom exists of inviting it into one's home. Incur the Pokémon's displeasure, however, and disaster will surely ensue."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"Its muttered curses can cause awful headaches or terrifying visions that torment others."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"Feared for its wrath and the curses it spreads, this Pokémon will also, on a whim, cast spells that help people."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"Mismagius have been known to cast spells to make people fall in love, so some people search for this Pokémon as if their life depended on it."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"It appears as if from nowhere—muttering incantations, placing curses, and giving people terrifying visions."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"Its cries sound like incantations to torment the foe. It appears where you least expect it."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","Pearl"],"text":"It chants incantations. While they usually torment targets, some chants bring happiness."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"Its cry sounds like an incantation. It is said the cry may rarely be imbued with happiness-giving power."},{"games":["Diamond"],"text":"Its cries sound like incantations. Those hearing it are tormented by headaches and hallucinations."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Levitate","hidden":false,"description":"By floating in the air, the Pokémon receives full immunity to all Ground-type moves."}],"eggGroups":["Amorphous"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":25,"baseHappiness":35,"growthRate":"fast","habitat":null,"color":"Purple","shape":"Ball","evolution":{"id":200,"name":"Misdreavus","condition":null,"children":[{"id":429,"name":"Mismagius","condition":"Use Dusk Stone","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,45],[1,180],[1,310],[1,345],[1,408],[1,566],[1,595]],"machine":[807,347,451,204,109,174,399,6